# ============================================================================
# What Docker must NEVER copy into the shop / admin image (step 48). Docker
# uses this file instead of the root .dockerignore for web.Dockerfile only.
# Secrets come from the server at RUN time, never at build time.
# ============================================================================

# ── Secrets and keys (CLAUDE.md Rule 3) ──────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
**/secrets/
**/*.secret*
id_rsa*
.npmrc

# ── Version control, editors, local tooling ─────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
*.log
.DS_Store

# ── Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image) ────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-e2e
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Not needed to build the shop or admin ───────────────────────────────────
docs
infrastructure
# Demo photos are generated locally (pnpm db:seed:demo) — never in an image.
apps/storefront/public/demo
# The API and workers have their own images; only their package.json stays
# (the workspace and pnpm-lock.yaml need them).
apps/api/**
!apps/api/package.json
workers/*/**
!workers/*/package.json
tests/**
!tests/e2e/package.json
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
